    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person is not permitted to apply under paragraph (1)(b)"
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "if, on or after October 26, 2023, they have made an application for an exemption order under section 490.02905 or 490.029111 in respect of the same obligation"

