        IF `s 490.04(4)(b) before or after the order was made, the person did what subparagraphs (b)(i) and following describe` EQUALS JUST TRUE
            THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The court shall not make an exemption order in respect of an application made under paragraph (1)(a) or (a.1) if"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The court shall not make an exemption order" names the cases in which it shall not and is silent on the rest

