§ `2026, c. 16, s. 51 -- section 490.05 (application for a termination order where the order or obligation applies for life)`

-- 51 (1) Paragraph 490.05(1)(a) is replaced by (a) and (a.1); (2) paragraphs 490.05(1)(c) and (d) are replaced by (b.1), (c) and (d): each names an order or obligation "if" it applies for life, with further conditions.
-- A failed "if" inside an item is the text's no for that item (marginal reading); an item outside the replaced paragraphs is NOT COVERED (the lead-in of subsection 490.05(1) is in-force text of part ccc18).
-- src:19726 | (a) an order made under section 490.012, if the order applies for life under subsection 490.013(2.1), as it read from time to time before October 26, 2023;
-- src:19727 | (a.1) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act, if the order applies for life under subsection 227.02(2.1) of that Act, as it read from time to time before the day on which this paragraph comes into force;
-- src:19728 | (2) Paragraphs 490.05(1)(c) and (d) of the Act are replaced by the following:
-- src:19729 | (b.1) an obligation under section 227.06 of the National Defence Act, if the obligation applies for life under paragraph 227.09(3)(d) of that Act and none of the offences listed in the prescribed form served on the person under that Act in respect of the obligation have a maximum term of imprisonment for life;
-- src:19730 | (c) an obligation under section 490.02901, if the obligation applies for life under paragraph 490.02904(3)(d), the obligation began before October 26, 2023 and the condition set out in paragraph 490.029051(1)(b) is met; or
-- src:19731 | (d) an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act, if the obligation applies for life under subsection 36.2(3) of that Act, the obligation began before October 26, 2023 and the condition set out in paragraph 490.029112(1)(b) is met.
@ref s 490.05(1)(a), (a.1), (b.1), (c) and (d) as replaced by 2026, c. 16, s. 51(1) and (2) (src:19726-19731)
DECLARE `s 490.05(1) (not in force) the order or obligation` IS ONE OF
    `s 490.05(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012`
    `s 490.05(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act`
    `s 490.05(1)(b.1) (not in force) an obligation under section 227.06 of the National Defence Act`
    `s 490.05(1)(c) (not in force) an obligation under section 490.02901`
    `s 490.05(1)(d) (not in force) an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act`
    `s 490.05(1) (not in force) something else`

@ref s 490.05(1) as replaced by 2026, c. 16, s. 51(1) and (2) (src:19726-19731)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 490.05(1) (not in force) the order or obligation`
      `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names` IS A BOOLEAN
      `none of the offences listed in the prescribed form served on the person under the National Defence Act in respect of the obligation has a maximum term of imprisonment for life` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the obligation began` IS A DATE
      `the condition set out in the paragraph the item names is met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.05(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in the replaced paragraphs` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 490.05(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` THEN
        IF `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an order made under section 490.012, if the order applies for life under subsection 490.013(2.1), as it read from time to time before October 26, 2023"
    WHEN `s 490.05(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` THEN
        IF `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act, if the order applies for life under subsection 227.02(2.1) of that Act"
    WHEN `s 490.05(1)(b.1) (not in force) an obligation under section 227.06 of the National Defence Act` THEN
        IF `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names` AND `none of the offences listed in the prescribed form served on the person under the National Defence Act in respect of the obligation has a maximum term of imprisonment for life`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an obligation under section 227.06 of the National Defence Act, if the obligation applies for life under paragraph 227.09(3)(d) of that Act and none of the offences listed in the prescribed form"
    WHEN `s 490.05(1)(c) (not in force) an obligation under section 490.02901` THEN
        IF `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names` AND `the day the obligation began` LESS THAN (Date 26 10 2023) AND `the condition set out in the paragraph the item names is met`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an obligation under section 490.02901, if the obligation applies for life under paragraph 490.02904(3)(d), the obligation began before October 26, 2023 and the condition set out in paragraph 490.029051(1)(b) is met"
    WHEN `s 490.05(1)(d) (not in force) an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` THEN
        IF `the order or obligation applies for life under the provision the paragraph names` AND `the day the obligation began` LESS THAN (Date 26 10 2023) AND `the condition set out in the paragraph the item names is met`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act, if the obligation applies for life under subsection 36.2(3) of that Act, the obligation began before October 26, 2023 and the condition set out in paragraph 490.029112(1)(b) is met"
